Sep 15 15:34:34.738184 kairos-a8ef immucore[654]:       Content: "[Unit]\nDescription=cOS system after FS setup\nDefaultDependencies=no\nAfter=local-fs.target\nWants=local-fs.target\nBefore=sysinit.target\n\n[Service]\nType=oneshot\nRemainAfterExit=yes\nExecStart=/usr/bin/kairos-agent run-stage fs\n# Belt-and-suspenders for the sysinit.target ordering: this\n# service is Before=sysinit.target, so if it hangs, every\n# later target (basic, multi-user) hangs with it and sshd\n# never comes up. run-stage fs pulls in config_url fetches\n# against a network that is not yet up at this ordering\n# point, and any silent stall inside kairos-agent (an\n# unbounded http.Get in old sdk/collector builds, a wedged\n# DNS resolver, a slow yip stage) becomes an invisible boot\n# hang. Cap the whole stage so a stall fails cleanly and\n# boot proceeds instead of dying at the login prompt.\nTimeoutStartSec=90\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=sysinit.target\n",
